B.aIT=new A.AR("ATS based Kerr-Cat Qubit","Participated in the research, design and development of **Asymmetrically Threaded SQUIDs (ATS)**-based Superconducting Kerr Cat Qubits. As a Sub-Team Lead, of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, Q3D, and KQLayout** for quantum circuit development. Under the supervision of **Dr. Shantanu Jha https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=CKj1TYUAAAAJ&hl=en&authuser=3** and **Mr. Muhammad Waqar Amin https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Muhammad-Waqar-Amin**. ",u.E,B.auM,null)
B.aIS=new A.AR("Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium","Participated in the research, design and development of **Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium (FTF)**-based Superconducting Qubits.With implementation of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, KQLayout, and QuTip** for quantum circuit development. My work focused on optimizing circuit parameters to enhance coherence and gate performance, contributing to advancements in superconducting qubit architectures.",u.E,B.eJ,null)
B.axt=s(["Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en"],t.s)
B.aIR=new A.AR("Quantum Mean Filter","As an **Intern** in Quantum Software Development at **Classiq**,under the supervision of **Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en**. I collaborated with my team to develop and implement a **Quantum Mean Filter** for **Quantum Signal Processing**. This project utilized advanced quantum techniques such as **NEQR (Novel Enhanced Quantum Representation), ENEQR (Extended NEQR), Cyclic Shift, Quantum Full Adder, and Quantum Multiplier** to implement algorithm, processing efficiency, and filtering accuracy.","Classiq",B.axt,u.y)
